Dragon Blast (2026-11-19): Zandatsu's renut/0030 with its fix renut/0033. The output to the screen in a command
list of its own, submitted after the game's list, on three-digit Mali GPUs (G310, G615, G710, G720...), against the
picture cut to a corner there. The overlay's texture uploads keep working in that list (0033: without it the FPS meter
was lost). swordman_renut_present_own_list: auto (default: three-digit Mali), true or false.

